/**********************************************************************************************************
** 
** PROCEDURE EliminarDimensao
** Objetivo: Verificar se a Dimensao que est† sendo eliminada Ç um registro padr∆o.
** Validaá‰es: N∆o pode ser um registro padr∆o para ser eliminado
** ParÉmetros: Entrada buffer b-dim-man            
**             Sa°da tt-bo-erro.
**********************************************************************************************************/
PROCEDURE EliminarDimensao:

    def parameter buffer b-dim-man for dim-man.
    def output param table for tt-bo-erro.

    for each tt-bo-erro:
        delete tt-bo-erro.
    end.
    
    if b-dim-man.log-reg-dtsul then do:
        run utp/ut-msgs.p (input 'msg',
                           input 17917,
                           input "").
        
        create tt-bo-erro.
        assign i-seq-erro          = i-seq-erro + 1
               tt-bo-erro.i-sequen = i-seq-erro
               tt-bo-erro.cd-erro  = 17917
               tt-bo-erro.mensagem = return-value.
    end.

END PROCEDURE.

/**********************************************************************************************************
** 
** PROCEDURE AlterarDimensao
** Objetivo: Atualizar tabela Dimens∆o Vis∆o Manufatura se o c¢digo da Dimens∆o for alterado.
** ParÉmetros: Entrada buffer b-dim-man
**             Entrada p-nova-dimensao
**********************************************************************************************************/
PROCEDURE AlterarDimensao:

    def parameter buffer b-dim-man for dim-man.
    def input parameter p-nova-dimensao like dim-man.cod-dimensao.
    
    if b-dim-man.cod-dimensao <> p-nova-dimensao then do:
       
       for each dim-vis-man where
                dim-vis-man.cod-dim-man = b-dim-man.cod-dim-man EXCLUSIVE-LOCK : 
          assign dim-vis-man.cod-dimensao = p-nova-dimensao.
       end.   
    
    end.

END PROCEDURE.
